.git
.venv

# On-prem production secrets and issued PKI material must NEVER enter a build
# context (the API image is built from the repo root with `COPY . /app`).
# Scoped to these directories so the bundled RDS CA under
# backend/oqtopus_cloud/common/certs is not affected.
deployment/onprem-prod/secrets/
deployment/onprem-prod/pki/out/

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

**/.coverage*
**/coverage*.xml
**/htmlcov*

# Terraform local caches/state must never enter the build context: the provider
# plugin cache is hundreds of MB (it filled the Docker disk during a build) and
# tfstate can contain secrets. None of it is needed by the Python image.
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*

# Node dependencies are always reinstalled in their own image, never copied in.
**/node_modules/
